# AI Tools for Troubleshooting

A practical guide to the AI tools commonly used in IT Support, Modern Workplace, and Security roles.  
This section explains what each tool is good at, its limitations, ethical considerations, and how to use AI safely in professional environments.

---

# 🤖 1. Why AI Matters in IT Support & Security

AI has become a core part of modern troubleshooting.  
It helps technicians:

- Diagnose issues faster  
- Interpret logs  
- Generate PowerShell  
- Summarise documentation  
- Improve communication  
- Reduce cognitive load  
- Learn new technologies  

But AI must be used **responsibly**, with awareness of risks and limitations.

---

